.TH tkufuzzy n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkufuzzy \- incremental fuzzy filter
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkufuzzy
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkufuzzy::widget .w]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Tk front-end built on the tclutils fuzzy engine (tufuzzy). See docs/tkufuzzy.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, fuzzy, filter
